description = "13 cogs with 11 teeth each

Arrange groupings in fibonacci series as drawn in sketch

Power surge required — still unknown, begin with 500 Volts, increase in increments of 2 to mitigate overload

	Insert final platinum chip BEFORE allowing gears to connect, repeat

	Gears should cascade in order of insertion

	Don't flip switch until all groupings have been turning for at least 5 minutes

	Wait hour for stabilization

		→ Barricade doors in case landlord asks about power spike again

"
